    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "A short account",
     "texto": [
      "**Săptămâna trecută** places the actions in the previous week. You can link events with **și** («and») or **apoi** («then»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Final state",
     "texto": [
      "**Eram obosit** describes how a man was; **eram obosită**, how a woman was. The imperfect presents the past state."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
